## Key Patterns

### Routing
Hash-based: `#dashboard`, `#ecommerce`, `#roi`, etc. Defined in `App.tsx` → `VALID_SECTIONS` array and `renderContent()` switch. Nav items in `AppShell.tsx` → `navItems` array with `SectionId` type.

### Adding a new page
1. Create component in `src/components/<name>/`
2. Add to `VALID_SECTIONS` in `App.tsx`
3. Add `case` in `renderContent()` (use `lazy()` for code splitting)
4. Add to `SectionId` type in `AppShell.tsx`
5. Add nav item in `navItems` array

### Data hooks
Pattern: `useQuery` + `getDoc`/`getDocs` from Firestore. See `useGA4Data.ts` or `useEcommerceSummary.ts` as reference. Always use `staleTime: 10min`, key by `brandId`.

### Connectors
OAuth flow: `connectorAuth` → external OAuth → `connectorCallback` → token stored in `connectors/{brandId}`.
API key flow: `connectorSaveCredentials` → credentials stored in `connectors/{brandId}`.
Sync: `connectorSync` (manual) or `scheduledSync` (daily cron). Each connector writes to its own collection + `import_jobs`.

### Firestore Collections
- `connectors/{brandId}` — connector configs & credentials (one doc per brand)
- `import_jobs` — sync logs (brandId-filtered)
- `shopify_orders`, `woo_orders`, `opencart_orders`, `magento_orders` — order data
- `shopify_products`, `woo_products`, `opencart_products`, `magento_products` — product data
- `ecommerce_summary/{brandId}` — aggregated e-commerce KPIs (server-write only)
- `ga4_data/{brandId}` — GA4 analytics data
- `campaigns/{docId}` — imported campaign data
- `products/{docId}` — imported product data
- `brands/{brandId}` — brand config
- `brand_members/{brandId}` — brand membership

### E-commerce Aggregation
`ecommerceAggregator.ts` → `computeEcommerceSummary(brandId)` reads all connected platform orders, computes totalRevenue/orderCount/aov/revenueByDay/revenueByMonth/revenueByPlatform/topProducts, writes to `ecommerce_summary/{brandId}`. Called after each e-commerce sync and in scheduledSync.

## Deploy
```bash
npm run build                    # Frontend only (tsc + vite)
npm run firebase:deploy:full     # Frontend build + functions build + `firebase deploy` (hosting, functions, rules)
npm run deploy:full              # `firebase:deploy:full` → `git add -A` → commit αν υπάρχουν αλλαγές → `git push`
```

Προαιρετικό μήνυμα commit: `DEPLOY_COMMIT_MSG="μήνυμα" npm run deploy:full`

**Agent:** Όταν ο χρήστης ζητάει **«full deploy»** (ή ισοδύναμο), εκτέλεσε `npm run deploy:full` από το root του repo.

