- All connectors operational: Google Ads, Meta, GA4, Shopify, WooCommerce, OpenCart, Magento, Merchant Center
- E-commerce Explorer page (`#ecommerce`) with KPIs, daily revenue chart, platform breakdown, top products, recent orders
- Dashboard e-commerce summary card with sparkline
- ROI Attribution: e-shop Revenue, True ROAS, Revenue Gap, store revenue trend line
- Firestore security rules: tenant isolation on all collections
- Help/Knowledge Base: 6 articles for Connectors & E-commerce category
- UX polish: loading states, status badges, table hover/sort, responsive tables, chart tooltip consistency

### Known warnings (pre-existing, not blockers)
- Vite circular dependency warnings (recharts re-exports, hooks barrel file) — cosmetic
- Node 20 deprecation notice — upgrade to Node 22 before Oct 2026
- `firebase-functions` package version warning — upgrade when ready for breaking changes
